hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5","[AI-translation] Hazrat Tamim Dari (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne paanch [cheezon] se mana farmaya: lambi zulfon (limmah) rakhne se, jootiyan pehenne se, masjidon mein baithe rehne se, saf [namaz jamaat] se peeche reh jane se, aur chadar aur tehband ko baghair [andaruni libas jaise] qameez ke pehenne se."
